    </author>
    <date year="2009" month="March"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document enumerates several common IANA allocations for use by
Mobile Ad hoc NETwork (MANET) protocols.  The following well-known
numbers are required: a UDP port number, an IP protocol number, and a
link-local multicast group address.</t>
    </abstract>
