        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Keyword</th>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Decimal</th>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Description</th>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">References</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">manet</td>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">269/udp</td>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">MANET Protocols</td>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">[RFC5498]</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-6-6">Action 2:</t>
      <t indent="3" pn="section-6-7">IANA has made the following assignments in the &quot;PROTOCOL NUMBERS&quot;
registry:</t>
      <t indent="3" pn="section-6-8">sub-registry &quot;WELL KNOWN PORT NUMBERS&quot;</t>
      <table align="center" pn="table-2">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Keyword</th>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Decimal</th>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Description</th>
            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">References</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">manet</td>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">138</td>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">MANET Protocols</td>
            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">[RFC5498]</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-6-10">Action 3:</t>
      <t indent="3" pn="section-6-11">IANA has made the following assignments in the &quot;Internet Multicast
Addresses&quot; registry:</t>
      <t indent="3" pn="section-6-12">sub-registry &quot;224.0.0.0 - 224.0.0.255 (224.0.0/24) Local Network
Control Block&quot;</t>
      <artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt="" pn="section-6-13"><![CDATA[
      224.0.0.109 LL-MANET-Routers   [RFC5498]
]]></artwork>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-6-14">Action 4:</t>
      <t indent="3" pn="section-6-15">IANA has made the following assignments in the &quot;INTERNET PROTOCOL
VERSION 6 MULTICAST ADDRESSES&quot; registry:</t>
      <t indent="3" pn="section-6-16">sub-registry &quot;Fixed Scope Multicast Addresses&quot;</t>
      <t indent="3" pn="section-6-17">sub-sub-registry &quot;Link-Local Scope&quot;</t>
      <artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt="" pn="section-6-18"><![CDATA[
      FF02:0:0:0:0:0:0:6D LL-MANET-Routers [RFC5498]
]]></artwork>
    </section>
    <section anchor="security-considerations" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-7">
      <name slugifiedName="name-security-considerations">Security Considerations</name>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-7-1">This document specifies only well-known numbers for protocols that
conform to <xref target="RFC5444" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC5444"/>, and it not does not specify the protocols that
carry the information across the network.  Each protocol using these
well-known numbers may have its own set of security issues, but those
issues are not affected by using the IANA allocations specified
herein.</t>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-7-2">The security issues associated with possibly operating multiple
cooperating protocols using the same IANA assignments (e.g., UDP
port) <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be addressed in each protocol's specification.</t>
    </section>
